        "excerpt": "Mä .ini qillqatawa notepad ukan apnaqasi wakichäwinak. Qillqatanakaparjam yänakapan mayjt'awinakapa imañataki.",
        "metaTitle": "Notepad Ukhanata .INI Qillqatanaka Lurawi: Jichhakam Yapt'äwi",
        "metaDescription": "Yatiñani Notepad Ukhanata .INI Qillqatanaka Lurawi: Aka jichhakam yapthäwiwa mä .ini qillqata lurañataki notepad apnaqasina.",
        "contentHtml": "<p>Mä .ini qillqatawa mä <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"https://notepad.is/ay/\"><strong>notepad</strong></a> ukan apnaqasi wakichäwinak qillqatanakaparjam yänakapan mayjt'awinakapa imañataki, ukhamat suma uñt'ata uñstxañapataki. Ukampiwa wakichäwinakax wakichata jikxatasi ukhamat apnaqirinakax jank'aki jist'arasa ukhamarak askichasa qillqatanakaru.</p><p>Walja Windows wakichäwinakaw .ini qillqatanak apnaqapjitu apnaqirinakan munäwinakap, munasirinakap ukhamarak wakichäwinakan ajllïwinakap imañataki.&nbsp;</p><h2 id=\"what-is-an-ini-file\"><strong>¿Kuna sutiw .ini qillqatasti?</strong></h2><p>Mä .INI qillqatawa (Initialization file suti juk'aptata) mä qillqatawa, ukax apnaqasiwa wakichäwi chimpunaka imañataki ukhamarak apnaqirinakaru sum yatiñapataki.</p><p>Jumax uñjaskaktawa akham sutilampi:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>config.ini</p></li><li><p>settings.ini</p></li><li><p>Appname.ini</p></li></ul><h2 id=\"why-create-ini-files\"><strong>¿Kunatsa .INI Qillqatanak Lurasiñapa?</strong></h2><p>Jaqinakatakiw .INI qillqatanak lurapxi walja suyt'äwinakataki:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Software wakichäwinakan mayjt'awinakapa</p></li><li><p>Anqata puklläwinakan wakichäwinakapa</p></li><li><p>Mantäwi yatiyawinaka jan ukax qillqatanak thakhinchäwi imañataki</p></li><li><p>App wakichäwinak lurawi</p></li><li><p>Juk'a yanapt'äwinak jan ukax qillqatanak lurawi</p></li><li><p>Wakichäwi pantjasiwinak askichaña qillqatanak mayjt'ayasina</p></li></ul><h2 id=\"what-tools-do-you-need-to-create-an-ini-file\"><strong>¿Kuna Yänakasa Munasi .INI Qillqata Lurañataki?<br></strong></h2><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Notepad (&nbsp; ukax Windows ukanx churatawa qalltatpach)</p></li><li><p>Mä PC jan ukax laptop</p></li><li><p>Mä qallta qillqäwi yatichäwi&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p>Ukakïkiwa; ni khitin qillqawi yatichäwipax munaskiti.</p><h3 id=\"step-by-step-create-an-ini-file-in-notepad\"><strong>Thakhi Thakhinchäwi: Mä .INI Qillqata Luraña Notepad Ukan&nbsp;</strong></h3><p>Katquir 8 juk'a thakhinchäwinak sarañani mä .INI Qillqata Notepad ukan lurañataki:&nbsp;</p><h3 id=\"step-1-open-notepad\"><strong>1. Thaqhinchäwi: Notepad Jist'araña&nbsp;</strong></h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Notepad jist'araña&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Ukatakix jank'akiw katqisma window chimpuchäwi + S&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Thaqhawi jist'araniwa &amp; qillqantañawa Notepad</p></li></ul><h3 id=\"step-2-write-simple-ini-content\"><strong>2. Thaqhinchäwi:&nbsp; Juk'a .INI Qillqäwi Qillqaña&nbsp;</strong></h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Qillqantaña .INI qillqäwi ukaru Notepad ukan akham :&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p><strong>&nbsp;[General]</strong></p><p><strong>username=John</strong></p><p><strong>theme=dark</strong></p><p><strong>language=English</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>[Display]</strong></p><p><strong>width=1920</strong></p><p><strong>height=1080</strong></p><p><strong>fullscreen=true</strong></p><p><strong>[Audio]</strong></p><p><strong>volume=80</strong></p><p><strong>mute=false</strong></p><h3 id=\"step-3-click-on-file\"><strong>3. Thaqhinchäwi: Qillqäwi (File) Ukaru Chuyllt'aña&nbsp;</strong></h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Mä kuti .INI qillqäwi qillqatakchi ukhaxa&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Chuyllt'am pañpach taypi patjjata &amp; churam Save As ajllïwiru</p></li></ul><h3 id=\"step-4-choose-save-location\"><strong>4. Thaqhinchäwi: Imañäwi Jikxataña Ajllitaña&nbsp;</strong></h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Jumax ajllismawa mayni imañäwi .INI qillqäwi imañataki, ukhamarak desktop, gallery, download, ukhamarakiwa.</p></li><li><p>Mä kuti ajllita uka qillqata, chuyllt'am imaña ajllïwiru. INI qillqataw ukan imataxa, ukat jani imaskasaxa, mayjt'am suti ukhamarak thakhi.</p></li></ul><h3 id=\"step-5-change-file-name\"><strong>5. Thaqhinchäwi: Qillqäwi Suti Mayjt'ayaña&nbsp;</strong></h3><p>Aka ukax wali aski thakhinchäwiwa &amp; qillqäwi luririnakax pantjasipjakiwa akankax<strong> :&nbsp;</strong></p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Mä kuti ajllisipki qillqäwi kawkhantix .INI qillqäwi imatajixa</p></li><li><p>Jumax imañama suti ukhamaraki .” INI “ yapata, cong.INI ukhamata</p></li></ul><h3 id=\"step-6-change-save-type\">&nbsp;<strong>6. Thaqhinchäwi: Imañäwi Laya Mayjt'ayaña&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></h3><p>Qillqäwi suti layanx, jikxatasmawa paya ajllïwinaka :&nbsp;</p><ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6 my-2\"><li><p><strong>Taqi Qillqatanaka (<em>.</em>)</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Qillqäwi Qillqatanaka (*.txt)&nbsp;</strong></p></li></ol><p>Jumax ajllima taqi qillqatanaka &amp; chuyllt'am imaña ajllïwiru.<br></p><h3 id=\"step-7-save-the-file\"><strong>7. Thaqhinchäwi: Qillqäwi Imaaña&nbsp;</strong></h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Jichhaxa, chuyllt'am imaña ajllïwiru</p></li><li><p>Juma INI qillqatawa lurasxi sumapuni</p></li></ul><h3 id=\"step-8-check-your-file\"><strong>8. Thaqhinchäwi: Qillqäwi Uñstayaña&nbsp;</strong></h3><p>Uñjañataki qillqataw sum lurasxi, jan ukax janiwa, lurañawa aka thakhinchäwinaka :&nbsp;</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Saräma kawkharutix .ini qillqata imarkta ukaru</p></li><li><p>Uñjaskätawa mä imata qillqäwi suti cong. INI ukhamata.</p></li><li><p>Jumax uñjasksta mayni qillqäwi suti imata mayni yapampi .ini tuqita, ukhaxa qillqataw pantjasita imata.</p></li><li><p>Yatiñanispawa qillqata imata tukuyasxi .ini ukhamaraki; janiwa wakichäwi qillqatajamapuni lurañkiti.</p></li></ul><h2 id=\"tips-for-working-with-ini-files\"><strong>Yatiyawinaka .INI Qillqatanakampi Lurañataki</strong></h2><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li><p>Apnaqam juk'a suti qillqatanakataki, jan yapakim qillqa chimpunaka amtañataki ch'amäki</p></li><li><p>Imañawa qillqäwi UTF-8 ukan&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Uñstayañawa qillqäwi mayampi mayjt'awinak qhipata</p></li><li><p>Yapt'añawa amtawinaka apnaqasina munaspaxa</p></li></ul><h2 id=\"common-problems-and-solutions\"><strong>Sapa kuti Pantjasiwinaka ukhamarak Askichäwinaka</strong></h2><p><strong>Pantjasiwi:</strong> imaña qillqäwi .txt jan ukax html .ini qhipäta</p><p><strong>Askichäwi: </strong>Sapa kuti imañawa qillqäwi .ini yapampi<br></p><p><strong>Pantjasiwi</strong>: Wakichäwix janiwa liykiti qillqäwi</p><p><strong>Askichäwi:</strong> Uñstayaña qillqäwi pantjasiwi &amp; ukhamaraki yatiñani janiwa apnaqatax k'uchu ch'usa.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pantjasiwi:</strong> Qillqa chimpunakat janiwa uñstaskiti sumapuni.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Askichäwi</strong>: Imaña qillqäwi UTF-8 qillqäwimpi. Sapa kuti ch'amachasiña yapantañataki juk'a Aymara/English qillqanaka &amp; jani apnaqaña qillqa chimpunaka.</p><h2 id=\"can-we-create-a-ini-file-using-online-notepad\">¿Lurasmawa mä .ini qillqata Internetan Notepad Apnaqasina?</h2><p>Janiwa, janiw chiqak lurasktati mä .ini qillqata <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"https://notepad.is/ay/\"><strong>mahhalla qillqäwi internetan notepad</strong></a> yänakampi. Ukatakix, apnaqasmawa Notepad Desktop wakichäwi sapaki.</p><h3 id=\"conclusion\"><strong>Tukuyäwi</strong></h3><p>Mä .ini qillqata lurañax wali juk'akiwa Notepad ukan. Mä kuti yatiyatätawa juk'a wakichäwi ukhamarak sum imañataki thakhi, jumax uñt'askätawa kawkïr wakichäwi .INI qillqatanak yanapt'i.</p>",
